% Scenario: a repeat count in the operator string. 35 repeats the
% lineto after it three times; the square is square-literal's, with the
% numbers as an ordinary array this time.
[ [0 0 100 100 10 10 90 10 90 90 10 90] <00 01 23 03 0a> ] ufill
showpage
